      "message": "Actually I\u0027m not sure the thread matters here ? It doesn\u0027t access any non-final members, so the threading behavior should be the same as what MulticastSocket uses\n\nWhich probably just does the same thing as what linux sockets do, and I think the system calls are thread-safe. Same for receive and close too; they should be safe to call on various threads, although the caller will likely get errors trying to send after close.",
